SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Anna with decorated bull\, Skala Kallonis
LOCATION:Skala Kallonis\, Lesvos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:A week before the sardine festival\, Skala Kallonis keeps Agia Anna (25 July) in the old Lesvos style: icon procession\, a garlanded bull led through the village\, local musicians and kiskek shared on the second day. Smaller and more traditional than the sardine crowds\; combine the two if you are on the island for the week.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lesvos/#skala-kallonis-panigiri-of-agia-anna-with-decorated-bull-ska
